---
// avatok.ai — /forgot-password.
//
// [WEB-PWLESS-1 2026-09-06] THERE ARE NO PASSWORDS ANY MORE. `password` is
// disabled on the Clerk instance (owner decision), sign-in is an emailed 6-digit
// code or Google, and the reset flow this page used to host cannot run: Clerk no
// longer offers `reset_password_email_code` for any account.
//
// The page is kept as a REDIRECT rather than deleted because the link is out in
// the world — in old emails, in browser history, and in anything that indexed
// the site before today. A 404 would tell someone who has "forgotten their
// password" that avaTOK is broken, when the honest answer is that there is
// nothing to forget. /sign-in now asks for an email and emails a code, which is
// exactly what they came here to do.
//
// 302, not 301: if passwords ever come back, a permanently-cached redirect in
// every visitor's browser would be very hard to undo.
export const prerender = false;

return Astro.redirect('/sign-in', 302);
---
